anguage=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> { Switch } </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\"> \"@/components/ui/switch\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"<Switch />\" data-language=\"tsx\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Switch</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\"> /></span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;switch-description&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"choice-card\">Choice Card</h2>\n<p>Card-style selection where <code>FieldLabel</code> wraps the entire <code>Field</code> for a clickable card pattern.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;switch-choice-card&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"disabled\">Disabled</h2>\n<p>Add the <code>isDisabled</code> prop to the <code>Switch</code> component to disable the switch. Add the <code>data-disabled</code> prop to the <code>Field</code> component for styling.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;switch-disabled&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"invalid\">Invalid</h2>\n<p>Add the <code>data-invalid</code> prop to the <code>Switch</code> component to indicate an invalid state. Add the <code>data-invalid</code> prop to the <code>Field</code> component for styling.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;switch-invalid&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"size\">Size</h2>\n<p>Use the <code>size</code> prop to change the size of the switch.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;switch-sizes&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"rtl\">RTL</h2>\n<p>To enable RTL support in shadcn/ui, see the <a href=\"/docs/rtl\">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;switch-rtl&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;direction&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;rtl&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"api-reference\">API Reference</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://react-aria.adobe.com/Switch#api\">React Aria Switch</a> documentation.</p>"
